{"title":"Where a request goes","stages":[{"name":"Webhook","does":"GitHub tells docz-api a push landed."},{"name":"Queue","does":"The push becomes an ingest job, debounced.","note":"A burst of pushes is one job."},{"name":"Ingest","does":"The worker fetches the tree and reconciles."}],"gates":[2],"label":"Each stage runs in order.","legend":"The green stage is a gate.","alert":"A failed ingest retries five times."}
